  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ca81259519cadfb2d5350673c220e419e60378e9770ad26512fc8e826a8d93f1.png] __Shortcut Trick__\n\nConvert the fractions into decimals for faster and easier multiplication.\n\n⇒ 2 ²/₅ = 2.4\n\n⇒ ³/₄ = 0.75\n\n⇒ Product = 1.2 × 2.4 × 0.75\n\n⇒ Rearranging for ease: (1.2 × 0.75) × 2.4 = 0.9 × 2.4 = 2.16\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 2.16.**\n\n<img height=\"26px\" src=\"https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c76c13ba2d2ab46b47f8a931ae621dac081a0cb266b142dc23f58659fac4a466.png\" width=\"26px\"",
